<%@ include file="header.jspf" %>
<h1>Access Settings</h1><p><c:out value="${access.name}"/> · Version <c:out value="${access.versionNumber}"/></p><c:if test="${not empty param.saved}"><p class="notice" role="status">Access settings saved.</p></c:if><section><form method="post" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/policy/preview"><%@ include file="csrf.jspf" %><input type="hidden" name="id" value="${access.id}"><input type="hidden" name="request" value="${approval.requestId}">
<label for="email">Recipient email</label><input id="email" type="email" name="email" maxlength="254" required value="<c:out value='${not empty approval.email ? approval.email : edit.email}'/>">
<label for="preset">Preset</label><select id="preset" name="preset"><option value="CUSTOM">Custom</option><option value="VIEW_ONCE">View once</option><option value="DOWNLOAD_ONCE">Download once</option><option value="DOWNLOAD_ONLY">Download only</option></select><p>Presets apply on the server. The next page shows their exact effect before confirmation.</p>
<div class="policy-grid"><div><label><input type="checkbox" name="viewing" ${edit.viewAllowed ? 'checked' : ''}>Allow viewing</label><label for="viewLimit">Maximum viewing sessions</label><input id="viewLimit" type="number" min="1" max="1000000" name="viewLimit" value="${edit.viewLimit}"><small>Blank means unlimited. View once allows one ten-minute session, no download and no resharing.</small></div>
<div><label><input type="checkbox" name="downloading" ${empty edit or edit.downloadAllowed ? 'checked' : ''}>Allow downloading</label><label for="downloadLimit">Maximum download transfers</label><input id="downloadLimit" type="number" min="1" max="1000000" name="downloadLimit" value="${edit.downloadLimit}"><small>Blank means unlimited.</small></div></div>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="resharing" ${edit.reshareAllowed ? 'checked' : ''}>Allow controlled resharing</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="otp" ${edit.otp ? 'checked' : ''}>Require OTP (always required for confidential files)</label>
<label for="expiry">Expiry in UTC (optional)</label><input id="expiry" type="datetime-local" name="expiry" value="${edit.expiryInput}">
<div class="policy-grid"><label for="start">Daily start (inclusive)<input id="start" type="time" name="start" value="${edit.startInput}"></label><label for="end">Daily end (exclusive)<input id="end" type="time" name="end" value="${edit.endInput}"></label><label for="timezone">IANA timezone<input id="timezone" name="timezone" maxlength="100" value="<c:out value='${empty edit.timezone ? "UTC" : edit.timezone}'/>"></label></div><small>Leave both times blank for no added restriction. Overnight windows are supported. Every ancestor's window still applies; repeated DST minutes follow local wall-clock time.</small>
<label for="targetVersion">Version target</label><select id="targetVersion" name="targetVersion"><option value="">Latest active version</option><c:forEach var="v" items="${versions}"><c:if test="${v.status eq 'ACTIVE'}"><option value="${v.id}" ${edit.targetValue eq v.id ? 'selected' : ''}>Version <c:out value="${v.number}"/> (pinned)</option></c:if></c:forEach></select>
<p>Editing never resets consumed counts. A new limit below the consumed count is rejected. Delegated recipients share limited ancestor budgets and cannot broaden effective permissions.</p><button>Review Exact Settings</button></form></section>
<section class="table-wrap"><h2>Recipient Tree and Usage</h2><c:choose><c:when test="${empty grants}"><p>No recipients yet.</p></c:when><c:otherwise><table><thead><tr><th>Recipient / parent</th><th>View sessions</th><th>Downloads</th><th>Conditions</th><th>Status / actions</th></tr></thead><tbody><c:forEach var="g" items="${grants}"><tr><td><c:out value="${g.email}"/><br>Grant <c:out value="${g.id}"/> · parent <c:out value="${g.parent}"/></td><td>Allowed: <c:out value="${g.viewAllowed}"/><br><c:out value="${g.viewsUsed}"/> used / <c:out value="${empty g.viewLimit ? 'Unlimited' : g.viewLimit}"/></td><td>Allowed: <c:out value="${g.downloadAllowed}"/><br><c:out value="${g.downloadsUsed}"/> used / <c:out value="${empty g.downloadLimit ? 'Unlimited' : g.downloadLimit}"/></td><td>Reshare: <c:out value="${g.reshareAllowed}"/><br>OTP: <c:out value="${g.otp}"/><br><c:out value="${g.hours}"/><br>Expiry: <c:out value="${g.expiresAt}"/><br>Version: <c:out value="${g.targetVersion}"/></td><td><c:out value="${g.state}"/><br><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/policy?id=${access.id}&amp;grant=${g.id}">Edit Settings</a><form method="post" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/revoke" data-confirm="Revoke this grant and its descendant branch?"><%@ include file="csrf.jspf" %><input type="hidden" name="id" value="${access.id}"><input type="hidden" name="grant" value="${g.id}"><button>Revoke Branch</button></form></td></tr></c:forEach></tbody></table></c:otherwise></c:choose></section>
<%@ include file="footer.jspf" %>
